  "title": "TWFG Insurance Announces Pricing of its Initial Public Offering",
  "summary": "PDF Version July 17, 2024 THE WOODLANDS, Texas, July 17, 2024 /PRNewswire/ — TWFG, Inc. (“TWFG”) today announced the pricing of its initial public offering of 11,000,000 shares of its Class A common stock at a price to the public of $17.00 per share, before underwriting discounts and commissions, for gross proceeds of $187.0 million. […]",
